{
  "id": 187808852,
  "iid": 8820,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "rdpudp: support desegmentation",
  "description": "The RDPUDP protocol transports TLS or DTLS records, but as the payload of RDPUDP is small,\nmost of the time records are splitted over multiple RDPUDP packets. This patch adds\nsupport for desegmentation in RDPUDP so that we interpret the results of the SSL\ndissector and we can give back untreated content when dissecting the next packet.",
  "state": "merged",
